OL,3,AEiffel Tower chief to quit after female
OL,4,Astaff replaced by men during religious
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chief executive of the company that
OL,8,Fruns the Eiffel Tower will step down
OL,9,Fafter a backlash over female staff
OL,10,Fbeing replaced by male colleagues
OL,11,Fduring a visit by a Hindu religious
OL,12,Fgroup.
OL,14,FPatrick Branco Ruivo, who has been
OL,15,Fdirector general of the Paris landmark
OL,16,Fsince 2018, will leave his job at the
OL,17,Fend of the year, the company SETE said
OL,18,Fin a statement.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
