OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEiffel Tower chief to quit after female
OL,4,Astaff replaced by men during religious
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said an internal investigation found
OL,8,Fthat "operational flaws and
OL,9,Fshortcomings" in organising the visit
OL,10,Fled to the "unacceptable" removal of
OL,11,Ffemale staff.
OL,13,FThey were replaced by male colleagues
OL,14,Fas a delegation of around 100 people
OL,15,Flinked to the Bochasanwasi Akshar
OL,16,FPurushottam Swaminarayan Sanstha (BAPS)
OL,17,Fgroup visited the Eiffel Tower earlier
OL,18,Fthis month.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
